title: Varde 2: a service row is curated by hand
scope: medium-grained, as-is, digitalized
info: How each of today's 138 rows entered the database: one source per field, two independent machine passes, and my ruling where they disagree. Nothing is guessed; an unconfirmed field stays empty. The re-check in sentence 11 runs every three months for acute lines (krisesentre, legevakt, nødtjenester) and every six months for every other row.
actors: Malin=Person, Researcher=System, Checker=System, Source=Group, GitHub=System
objects: Research brief=Document, Official page=Document, Seed notes=Document, Check report=Document, Call list=Call, Final values=Info, Seed row=Document, Pull request=Document, Re-check=Info
